MGR_MOD_CARD_NIGHT_WALKER.description:
Add a random [gold]Curse[/gold] to your [gold]Discard Pile[/gold].
For each [gold]Curse[/gold] [gold]In Combat[/gold], deal {Damage:diff()} damage to a random enemy.{InCombat:
(Attack {TotalHits:diff()} times.)|}

MGR_MOD_CARD_MAGURO_DASH.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage to ALL enemies.
End all [gold]Performance[/gold] cards. Repeat once per card ended.{InCombat:
(Attack {TotalHits:diff()} times.)|}

MGR_MOD_CARD_BIRD.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
Generate random [gold]BasicNote[/gold] equal to half the damage.{InCombat:
(Generate {CalculatedNotes:diff()}.)|}

MGR_MOD_CARD_GAZE.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
Gain {CalculationExtra:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold] for each unique debuff on that enemy.{InCombat:
(Gain {CalculatedBlock:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold].)|}
